      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحالم</span></b>  <i>He made a show of having</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحِلْم</span>
[i. e. <i>forbearance,</i> or <i>clemency,</i> &amp;c.], <i>not having
it;</i> (S, TA; *) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تحلّم</span></b>  [in like manner] signifies [sometimes] <i>he made a show of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الحِلْم</span>;
expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَظْهَرَ الحِلْمَ</span>. (TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فصح</span>.)

